  "content": [
    {
      "text": "A city of Judah in the valley of Elah, near Lachish and Gath. It is involved in the David-Goliath story (1 Sam. 17:1) and is mentioned in 2 Chr. 11:9; Jer. 34:7. The Lachish letters in ink on broken bits of pottery also mention Azekah and were written nearby.",
